### :V:2: with extra-sources section
### <current-file>
yes, there is something
### <pkg:pkg-extra-sources-square.1>
opam-version: "2.0"
build: [
  [ "test" "!" "-f" "random-file" ]
  [ "test"  "-f" "current-file" ]
]
### <xs.sh>
md5=$(openssl md5 random-file | cut -d' ' -f2)
cat >> REPO/packages/pkg-extra-sources-square/pkg-extra-sources-square.1/opam << EOF
extra-sources: [ "file://$BASEDIR/random-file" "md5=$md5" ]
extra-source "current-file"  {
  src:"file://$BASEDIR/current-file"
  checksum: [ "md5=$md5" ]
}
EOF
### sh xs.sh
### opam update default

